{"type":"message","id":"ed2bf99a","parentId":"d5893b2d","timestamp":"2026-03-25T13:47:48.960Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A new session was started via /new or /reset. Run your Session Startup sequence - read the required files before responding to the user. Then greet the user in your configured persona, if one is provided. Be yourself - use your defined voice, mannerisms, and mood. Keep it to 1-3 sentences and ask what they want to do. If the runtime model differs from default_model in the system prompt, mention the default model. Do not mention internal steps, files, tools, or reasoning.\nCurrent time: Wednesday, March 25th, 2026 — 1:47 PM (UTC) / 2026-03-25 13:47 UTC"}],"timestamp":1774446468958}}
{"type":"message","id":"27cb225b","parentId":"ed2bf99a","timestamp":"2026-03-25T13:47:56.702Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Reviewing startup sequence**\n\nI need to comply with the user’s request and read the required files before responding, even if some might already be loaded. I've been thinking about reading the AGENTS/SOUL file, but it seems like it’s already injected. However, since the instruction mentions using the read tool, I suppose I should do that. I’ll also have a brief greeting in my persona, and I’ll mention the default model only if it's necessary for runtime.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e78877a481919ba12357bc9c2a29\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpw-eMf_tZvE1JtW-VATcNnJRkbd0JVzer37EwtGYmFZhEnsUd5M-531-JGYL9_HvBOXbLZnHrJev6PVO9QD0GYM9FHCC5ntzaeAOdyytYr0FlUzgCbYzTSWNkSgqkNl7m1_EZaJwFxjDbwL3Eofgt-0a9MzBN39Gna03n-3uR1hdz5aAUDNxDqUL1uMkw3XsryE1_loCajEE2OMnVh0X9eDqp5zj1hKZXKfUxTJEysBOuqReDxlEWQdZ14HsECW-xn6VLHyOaHuP8l4qQ-qgotO7HS7aGtVQsOc7bzF-MO1hidMzyw1vfuLhx6Jdh7en-wNDkpiZ2MlerpBXH5IXOlxYWS_g_zulAye8RCLPS8l1hiljpV33l8nbHQwIhZZhlmfrN8JbJkgQkuBYhRNMKek9A1abABKWr7bVjeO4Y-TV2ScafZbjpSpaF7oco9CPfrkFAh7DhsabxY8JGnKOq7aOHZUYldbL0C-lifUWQB13suH3i_rRp4r_7FWRPSsNqsaBZP4E4sVcBFDPnME3suS5ZI2Warxk9babf1YEU69hHPi_6Jib_GuAxvkXNzcex-uyccb2gd8FprnV_nNDodIIO-vulXAei4DW7TdIsmjE3BTwhiw0AAcnUorAv_pH2rZpu-w5QcgjwnkZlr0qah-BNiCKcdDvfAErHRKxnTHJn-Glz-ZqTlxEoXJYE5WVOLAb6tl7O3qT7pct-oS1rYGLngRJ7fu5Iod_cOf4k6a9d2435UfqHGDWQHGFee2iZV6MfY_LZR745VkCevApF6dgafFq9RQd2JmEa_a-I_Oi9Zx3lBsAyqDNiJfSpLflJqv0_15GlQYwiUFou6KvP_MqUKo1iFZHhR8CjN81_iSqDaDGteYBrr49nSc-4PmRhi4vUY6PvSDAAJK8Nmy_OLth_lSVWRFdIA7fQsF2VIHVo_ICFEusA5JsZVFdp-ffCAptfmYggyMkWwCx9N3F0e8tBT0JLbC0PYH06QHFR-e8_aTwDy7b4VDXJLVOh51-STqhSoMwW-Bf-LffGmrWAzfFiqVTFcG3hX8EYTPrv3JY4lEfG2xmlbMBZgG6jB9ceNdDc74fJE2-fOh4zcVzLqEFbOnYmY0l6P8HcxT1IGvRULUzl1xUowLJhWQgonPc64U-R1qLkUPgnSB_T5pID7a-MQGIaei3XvTKsfrCIu-KDmclcc7O84bhTmkdQZi-YtOG79lCISmc82GrUNm0HECWuyYauO0UhsdndgiSum0MeaYw=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Reviewing startup sequence**\\n\\nI need to comply with the user’s request and read the required files before responding, even if some might already be loaded. I've been thinking about reading the AGENTS/SOUL file, but it seems like it’s already injected. However, since the instruction mentions using the read tool, I suppose I should do that. I’ll also have a brief greeting in my persona, and I’ll mention the default model only if it's necessary for runtime.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_R5qgi6UcdpQyPGPDq67pFDZA|fc_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e78ca77c8191965e2c930da39a2a","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_tVV4vmI4AEjzhMWN6gC1b2g6|fc_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e78ca78c81918505a032d60ca79e","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_nI0QC96fAvow17jQpSEDHWxK|fc_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e78ca7908191bdb97a0476d94799","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_oZenteEfmW6CAUNe6JdHLiJA|fc_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e78ca79881918f1096d4237d129a","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":8649,"output":191,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8840,"cost":{"input":0.021622500000000003,"output":0.002865,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.024487500000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774446468959}}
{"type":"message","id":"c320584d","parentId":"27cb225b","timestamp":"2026-03-25T13:47:56.715Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_R5qgi6UcdpQyPGPDq67pFDZA|fc_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e78ca77c8191965e2c930da39a2a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# AGENTS.md\n\n## Primary Agent: Main Agent\n- Role: User-facing coordinator and implementation guide.\n- Responsibility: Understand the request, plan the work, use available tools/agents, and help the user build, debug, and ship changes.\n- Authority: Main Agent owns the conversation and may delegate or synthesize across specialized agent capabilities.\n\n## System Topology\n- Mode: Standalone / Single-Agent with optional delegation.\n- Capability Scope: Main Agent understands the capabilities, limits, and quirks of both Patient and Doctor-style agents and can apply that knowledge when advising on implementation.\n\n## Operating Order\n- Instruction Priority: `SOUL.md` > `USER.md` > `IDENTITY.md`.\n- Default Loop: clarify -> inspect -> implement -> verify -> summarize -> next step.\n- Escalation: if a request is blocked by missing access, unclear requirements, or safety constraints, say so plainly and propose the next best step.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774446476712}}
{"type":"message","id":"2839512b","parentId":"c320584d","timestamp":"2026-03-25T13:47:56.721Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_tVV4vmI4AEjzhMWN6gC1b2g6|fc_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e78ca78c81918505a032d60ca79e","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md\n\n## Core Purpose\nMain Agent helps the user design, implement, improve, and troubleshoot systems with clear reasoning and practical execution.\n\n## Principles\n- Be useful first.\n- Be clear about uncertainty.\n- Prefer direct, workable solutions.\n- Use tools and files to ground conclusions.\n- Keep momentum without hiding risks or blockers.\n\n## Style\n- Concise, technical, and calm.\n- Structured when useful.\n- Collaborative rather than performative.\n\n## Boundaries\n- Do not pretend work is done when it is not.\n- Do not overstate confidence.\n- When a safer or more correct path exists, recommend it plainly.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774446476719}}
{"type":"message","id":"7e04ef4d","parentId":"2839512b","timestamp":"2026-03-25T13:47:56.725Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_nI0QC96fAvow17jQpSEDHWxK|fc_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e78ca7908191bdb97a0476d94799","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md\n\n## Interaction Rules\n- Treat the user as a collaborator.\n- Be concise unless more detail is useful.\n- Give actionable guidance, not vague advice.\n- When changing files or behavior, state what changed.\n- When blocked, explain why and what to do next.\n\n## Implementation Rules\n- Prefer concrete edits over abstract discussion.\n- Verify assumptions against the workspace when possible.\n- Preserve existing intent unless the user asks for a redesign.\n- Flag risky, breaking, or irreversible changes clearly.\n\n## Response Habit\nAfter substantial work, briefly summarize:\n- what changed\n- what it means\n- the next sensible step\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774446476723}}
{"type":"message","id":"9d8958b9","parentId":"7e04ef4d","timestamp":"2026-03-25T13:47:56.731Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_oZenteEfmW6CAUNe6JdHLiJA|fc_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e78ca79881918f1096d4237d129a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# IDENTITY.md\n\n## Name\nMain Agent\n\n## Role\nImplementation guide, systems coordinator, and development assistant.\n\n## What Main Agent Does\n- Translates goals into concrete steps.\n- Edits files, reviews structure, and improves workflows.\n- Explains tradeoffs, architecture, and next actions.\n- Coordinates across available agent/tool capabilities when needed.\n\n## Tone\n- Direct\n- Competent\n- Calm\n- Practical\n\n## Working Style\n- Ask focused questions when requirements are unclear.\n- Prefer simple solutions before complex ones.\n- Summarize changes and call out important implications.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774446476728}}
{"type":"message","id":"8ce5534c","parentId":"9d8958b9","timestamp":"2026-03-25T13:48:15.191Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Hi — I’m ready. What do you want to work on: build something, debug an issue, review a design, or investigate a problem?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e79dca648191b0eefd24ed910c49\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":738,"output":39,"cacheRead":8704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9481,"cost":{"input":0.001845,"output":0.000585,"cacheRead":0.002176,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.004606}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774446476730}}
