s to ensure everything is set up correctly. I think I might be able to create something under the directory /home/node/.openclaw/skills/slm-nephrology. It’s worth looking for where init_skill.py is located, which I suspect could be in /app/skills/skill-creator/scripts. Let’s go ahead and inspect that. It seems like a logical next step!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"I’ll scaffold the skill, write the instructions and helper script, then package it so it’s ready to install/use later once you fill in the endpoint.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e8979aa4819194963efedf16244d\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_yxSUy0bexlSEMVc3r0xlpWPm|fc_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e8985bb481919d2e890c773899d9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /app/skills/skill-creator -maxdepth 3 -type f | sort","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"find /app/skills/skill-creator -maxdepth 3 -type f | sort\",\"workdir\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Y9iEvuz2uTalTVTCDZxCDyam|fc_06b4787a018aa87e0169c3e8985bc48191ade8ab2e175f0bac","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/node/.openclaw/skills || true","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"ls -la /home/node/.openclaw/skills || true\",\"workdir\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":4144,"output":207,"cacheRead":9472,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13823,"cost":{"input":0.010360000000000001,"output":0.003105,"cacheRead":0.002368,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.015833}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774446739356}}
